  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">KARNATAKA WIND</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Project is expected to result in reduction of Green House Gas (GHG) emissions by supplying electricity generated from wind power to the grid. The reduction in GHG is measured by the Certified Emission Reductions (CERs) issued by the project. The project is expected to issue 882,401 CERs over the ten year crediting period from September 2008 to August 2018.</narrative>
  </description>
